# Build context is the repo root; BuildKit uses this file (named after the
# Dockerfile) instead of a root .dockerignore. Keep the context to the
# workspace manifests, apps/tax-receipts, and packages.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.claude
**/.DS_Store
apps/tax-receipts/api/src/generated
apps/tax-receipts/api/storage
.git
docs
gpoAutoTests
google-workspace
scripts
